"insay di URL na di ples we di pɔsin we de kɔl in fon nɔmba fɔ go.\n"
"\n"
"Fɔ ɛgzampul: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"We yu prɛs di sach bɔtin we kɔl de go, wi go chenj '{number}' to di rial fon "
"nɔmba ɛn opin am na yu difɔlt brawza."

